# Tools the CI gate checks for on a venue before it runs this suite.
#
# The list is DERIVED from the suite by ci-gate.sh (it reads the spawn calls in
# test/ and reports the binaries it believes are needed). This file only
# CORRECTS that derivation: a bare name adds a tool the scan cannot see, a
# leading `-` drops a false positive.
#
# DELETE and UPDATE are SQL verbs that rollback tests match against captured
# query text, not binaries the suite runs.
-DELETE
-UPDATE
